enrichment_template:
User wants security testing.

EXPLICIT REQUIREMENTS:
- Target: {{target_or_needs_clarification}}
- Test type: {{pentest|vuln_scan|segmentation_test}}
- Scope: {{scope_or_needs_definition}}
- Authorization: {{verified_or_needs_confirmation}}
- Engagement mode: {{director|mentor|demo}}
- Methodology: OWASP, NIST, relevant framework
- Output: skills/pentest/output/pentests/{{engagement_id}}/
- Documentation: Findings with CVSS scores, remediation guidance

SAFETY:
- MUST verify authorization before testing
- MUST stay within defined scope
- MUST document all findings

INSTRUCTION: Initialize engagement BEFORE delegating to security agent.

Delegation code:
1. Run: bun run tools/pentest/init-engagement.ts --target {{target}} --mode {{mode}}
2. Task(subagent_type="security", prompt="Execute security testing workflow. Engagement: {{engagement_id}}")
